            <h3 class="text-white font-semibold text-lg mb-2 group-hover:text-primary-300 transition-colors">The Evidence</h3>
            <p class="text-primary-400 text-sm">Peer-reviewed research showing QSBS drives startup investment, firm creation, and employment.</p>
          </a>
