          All data sourced from U.S. Treasury, IRS, and peer-reviewed academic research.
          This site presents factual analysis and is not tax advice.
        </p>
        <p class="text-xs text-primary-600 mt-2">Updated September 2026. New York kept QSBS. Oregon, Maine, Illinois, Vermont, and Rhode Island decoupled (RI in 2027). Washington and Maryland bills failed.</p>
      </div>
